title: 'sp-additional-data: primitives for per-block additional data'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Runtime Dev]
  description: |-
    Adds `sp-additional-data`, the producer-agnostic primitives for per-block additional data: the
    `AdditionalData` map and its commitment functions, the `AdditionalDataFinalizer` registry held
    in the `AdditionalDataExt` externalities extension, the `finalize_into` host function, and the
    header commitment, an `H256` carried as a `DigestItem::Consensus` log under the `addt` engine
    id.

    Nothing registers the host function or deposits the log yet, so existing chains are
    unaffected.
crates:
- name: sp-additional-data
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: minor
